###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - No training, data set, hyperparameter setting or accuracy metric (Q2-Q6 and Q8-Q10 empty). The pretrained model is given as 'MACE-MP-0 medium [15]' without a release; it is not linked to a registry model, because the registry distinguishes the 2023.12.03 release from the 0b3 checkpoint and the paper does not say which was used.
# - Thermodynamic integration is asserted for entity:MACE on the basis of the alchemical and Frenkel-Ladd free-energy calculations (free energy of vacancy formation in bcc iron, composition changes); geometry optimisation and MD on the basis of the relaxations and sampling runs with the alchemically modified model.
# - The CHGNet results of the supplementary information are not encoded. Results on lattice parameters and band-gap trends of solid solutions, order-disorder energetics of double perovskites and free energies have no MetricProperty.
# - The alchemical modification itself (weighted 'alchemical' atoms in the graph) is a new capability of the method that schema 0.1.2 has no term for.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
